(Thus we need oa's task_profile linked for allocate_dispatch_slot for oa, and da's task_profile linked for allocate_dispatch_slot for da.)
(We currently have oa's task_profile linked (step24). Da's task_profile is not linked (we detached at step16). So we need to attach da's task_profile.)
(But we cannot have both oa and da linked simultaneously because rtp availability false after first attach. So we need to do one at a time.)
(We'll do oa first:)
(28. allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate oa ds rtp   (needs dispatch_ready oa true, candidate_task_profile_linked oa rtp true, dispatch_slot_available ds true, not dispatch_allocated oa))
(Effects: dispatch_allocated oa true, candidate_dispatch_slot_linked oa ds true, dispatch_slot_available ds false.)
(29. execute_origin_dispatch oa vu_a ds   (needs dispatch_allocated oa true, candidate_vehicle_linked oa vu_a true (step2), candidate_dispatch_slot_linked oa ds true, not dispatched oa))
(Effects: dispatched oa true, vehicle_available vu_a true, dispatch_slot_available ds true.)
(Now after dispatch, vehicle vu_a free, ds free.)
(Now we can detach oa's task_profile (optional) and attach da's task_profile.)
(30. detach_task_profile oa rtp   (frees rtp))
(31. attach_task_profile da rtp   (needs candidate_created da true, vehicle_allocated da true (step10), route_task_profile_available rtp true (now free)))
(Effects: candidate_task_profile_linked da rtp true, route_task_profile_available rtp false.)
(32. allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate da ds rtp   (needs dispatch_ready da true (step27), candidate_task_profile_linked da rtp true, dispatch_slot_available ds true, not dispatch_allocated da))
(Effects: dispatch_allocated da true, candidate_dispatch_slot_linked da ds true, dispatch_slot_available ds false.)
(33. execute_destination_dispatch da vu_beta ds   (needs dispatch_allocated da true, candidate_vehicle_linked da vu_beta true (step10), candidate_dispatch_slot_linked da ds true, not dispatched da))
(Effects: dispatched da true, vehicle_available vu_beta true, dispatch_slot_available ds true.)
(Now detach da's task_profile:)
(34. detach_task_profile da rtp   (frees rtp))
(Now oa and da dispatched, vehicles vu_a and vu_beta free, operator free (we released after locks), rtp free.)
(Now schedule candidates.)
(We need to prepare scA and scB similarly, using rtp.)
(We'll need to attach task_profile for each candidate during prepare, confirm_preparedness, assign_operator, assign_skill, assign_compliance, apply_operational_constraint, confirm_operator_alignment, verify_compliance, finalize, allocate_dispatch_slot, execute_schedule_dispatch.)
(We can follow similar pattern: attach, do steps up to allocate_dispatch_slot, then detach after execute.)
(We'll need operator for each; we'll release after each use.)
