(60. finalize_candidate_after_compliance_validation scB)
(61. allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate scB ds rtp)
(62. execute_schedule_dispatch scB vu_alpha ds)
(63. release_operator_resource scB op)
(64. detach_task_profile scB rtp)
(Now all four dispatched.)
